sequenceDiagram
    actor Op as Operator
    participant Replay as npm run replay:dlq
    participant DLQ as foc.rating.dlq
    participant Handler as Grant or user handler
    participant DB as Postgres

    Op->>Replay: kubectl exec deploy/rating
    Replay->>DLQ: read as group rating-service-dlq-replay, from the last commit
    loop each dead letter written before this run started
        alt headers unreadable, or topic Rating does not handle
            Replay-->>Op: dropped, logged in full
        else readable
            Replay->>Handler: original message
            Handler->>DB: apply, already applied changes nothing
            alt applied
                Note over Replay: replayed
            else still throws or invalid, under 5 replays and 30 days
                Replay->>DLQ: re-queue at the end, replay count + 1
            else 5th failed replay, or 30 days since the first failure
                Replay-->>Op: expired, logged in full
            end
        end
        Replay->>DLQ: commit offset
    end
    Replay-->>Op: replayed, requeued, expired, dropped
